#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:192
msgid "Note: Each Federation Route of the Gateway must be configured manually for explicit download, to avoid misunderstandings in configuration. This is important for security reasons. All trust anchors must be onboarded otherwise the content is filtered out."
